&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Customer Growth Account Executive, you’ll own expansion across a book of existing customer accounts, uncovering opportunities to cross-sell and upsell across Klaviyo’s product portfolio. Partnering closely with Customer Success, Renewals, Partnerships, and other cross-functional departments, you’ll connect customer goals to the right solutions, build compelling business cases, and guide thoughtful buying decisions that create lasting value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact commercial role for a customer-focused seller who combines curiosity, analytical rigor, and disciplined execution to deliver predictable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a focused account plan across your book of business, prioritizing high-potential customers and mapping stakeholders to create expansion pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle from prospecting to consultative discovery to tailored product demonstrations that connect customer needs to measurable business outcomes, not just product features to commercials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop ROI-backed recommendations, and align both champions and economic buyers around the value and path forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Success, Renewals, Solution Architects, Partnerships, and Marketing to coordinate customer engagement, accelerate value realization, and deliver a seamless experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a healthy pipeline and rigorous Salesforce hygiene, with accurate stages, close dates, next steps, and clear forecast rationale, employing MEDDPICC, BANT, and 3 Whys (Why buy anything, Why buy Klaviyo, Why buy now?).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on customer needs, the market, and evolving Klaviyo solutions, including new capabilities, and AI-first workflows and processes to improve customer engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of strong, consistent SaaS Account Executive performance. Multi-product platform experience is preferred. Martech experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence running a methodology-driven, time-bound, value-led sales process with strong discovery and consultative selling skills, translating business goals into relevant solutions and measurable value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to engage a range of stakeholders, from day-to-day partners to executive sponsors and economic buyers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial judgment and negotiation discipline: you can build consensus, manage a structured evaluation, and close on value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical, organized approach to account planning, pipeline management, and forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise communication and presentation skills, with the ability to tailor your message to different audiences. This is a highly cross-functional role and consistently sharing proactive, written updates to broad groups is an expected part of the sales process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, growth-minded approach: you seek feedback, share what works, and work effectively across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using sales productivity tools; experience with tools such as Salesforce, Gong, Linkedin, GSuite, Slack, Claude, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree or equivalent experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to be hybrid in our Denver office 3x per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This description reflects the role’s current responsibilities; expectations may evolve over time.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
