&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Account Executives at Klaviyo have the opportunity to make a huge impact — on our prospects, our company’s trajectory, and their own careers. We pride ourselves on being product experts who close deals the right way, with the right customers, and set them up for long-term success.As an AE at Klaviyo, you will run the full sales cycle — from qualification through demo, driving the buying process, and closing — while managing dozens of prospects simultaneously. The most successful AEs close over 70% of their opportunities, forecast with accuracy, and proactively manage and extract value from their territory over time.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;The Customer Growth team in Eastern Europe is responsible for selling our suite of products into our EMEA install base. The Commercial segment contains Klaviyo’s customers who each drive $2.5-30M in annual revenue and you will manage a book of business of 500-700 accounts spread across markets in Eastern Europe.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;How You’ll Make an Impact&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Build Klaviyo’s client base across the EMEA region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Actively manage your pipeline and develop a strategy for long-term, sustained success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Support the success of your peers and collaborate cross-functionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Apply AI fluency to streamline work, reallocate saved time and reinvest into more meaningful, high-impact areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Exhibit Klaviyo’s values of accountability and effort in everything you do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Provide mentorship and guidance to new Account Executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Expand your skillset by contributing to adjacent projects over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Who You Are&lt;/div&gt;
