&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-lfile-container=&quot;30dc6296-c3f3-4837-8364-d8f28ffb0f5f&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;As a Customer Success Manager, you&#39;ll help hundreds of brands get more from Klaviyo through 1:many and 1:1 engagement. You&#39;ll join a high-impact global team that drives adoption, retention, and growth across a large customer base, using data and AI to decide where your time has the most impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll run a high volume of customer engagements (calls, webinars, and in-person events), spot friction and risk early, and act on it. You&#39;ll balance an at-scale mindset with an account-centric approach, supporting customer success and growth throughout the customer lifecycle and owning retention and expansion (cross-sell and up-sell) outcomes for the customers you support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who is data-led, curious about how AI is changing customer success, and at home in a fast-paced, changing environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Engage customers at scale&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give expert guidance on marketing strategy and roadmaps, campaign and automation reviews, deliverability, growth and retention strategy, and industry benchmarks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver actionable insights and strategic recommendations cross-functionally to Sales, Support, and Product/Engineering teams, including customer feedback and friction patterns you see at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Retain and grow&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own retention and expansion (cross-sell and up-sell) outcomes for the customers you support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act promptly on customer alerts and risk signals, and own each issue through to resolution, coordinating with Support, Sales, and Product as needed and keeping the customer informed until it is closed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Work smarter with AI and data&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools and customer data to spot risk and expansion signals, prioritise outreach, and personalise engagement at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and share AI-assisted workflows, templates, and playbooks, and check AI outputs for accuracy before they reach customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers get more value from Klaviyo&#39;s AI-powered capabilities as part of their marketing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Collaborate&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share insights, customer feedback, and friction patterns with Sales, Support, and Product/Engineering, and work closely with the wider global team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of customer-facing experience, building relationships, managing expectations, solving problems, and knowing when to escalate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, with a habit of turning data into insights and clear recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consultative and business savvy, with strong negotiation skills and confidence in financial conversations and handling objections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid marketing tech knowledge, ideally across omnichannel digital marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI fluent: you use AI tools regularly (for example, to summarise account data, draft personalised outreach, or build reusable prompts and workflows), share what works, and know when to check outputs and when human judgement is needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of driving product adoption with a coach&#39;s mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisation, project management, and communication skills by phone, video, and email&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who thrives in both collaborative and autonomous settings, balances an at-scale mindset with an account-centric approach, and adapts quickly to change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in the office 3 days a week (Dublin Hub)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German speaker: Native or CEFR Level C2 (Mastery / Proficiency)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a high-growth SaaS company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a one-to-many or shared-coverage engagement model&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Past Customer Success or Account Management role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting customers in the ENT/SMB segment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building AI-assisted workflows or automations in a customer-facing role&lt;/li&gt;
