&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team and role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More and more buyers start with a question to an AI assistant instead of a search box, and Klaviyo intends to be the brand that the answer recommends first. As Head of Organic Search, you own how Klaviyo shows up across traditional search, answer engines, and the app stores and marketplaces where buyers discover us. You’ll sit in Growth and work daily with Content &amp;amp; Product Marketing, Product &amp;amp; Engineering, Paid Media, Web, and Analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supervisory responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruits, interviews, hires, and trains new staff.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversees the daily workflow of the department.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides constructive and timely performance evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handles discipline and termination of employees in accordance with company policy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set Klaviyo’s vision and educate internal stakeholders on how AI-generated answers reshape organic discovery, and build the&amp;nbsp; playbook to win in AI assistants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Klaviyo’s global organic search strategy and the traffic, sign-ups, and ARR it drives, across traditional SEO and AEO, using performance data, competitor deep dives, and audience insights to prioritize opportunities and close coverage gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical SEO and AEO, working with Engineering and Web to experiment with new delivery techniques that keep Klaviyo fast and legible to both people and bots.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Content to build roadmaps that balance long-term bets with fast response to search shifts, protecting quality while improving performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Product Marketing, Engineering, Social, and Community to turn SEO and AEO opportunities into shipped work across blog, video, social, and community surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hand in hand with the Paid Media team to see the full picture of search: shared keyword and query insight, paid and organic coverage, and one view of where demand is won or lost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend Klaviyo’s presence across every surface where buyers look, including app store and marketplace listings, reviews, communities, and third-party sources that AI systems learn from.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relentlessly test new plays for traditional and AI search visibility, from new page types to new content formats, scaling what works and stopping what doesn’t. Build repeatable systems, AI workflows, and guidelines that make the team faster and more consistent, and lead from the front on what AI makes possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the measurement framework for SEO and AEO: attribution models, leading and lagging indicators, and the revenue impact of organic and AI search. Translate it into clear business stories for senior leadership: what is driving performance, what it means for sign-ups and ARR, and where to invest next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, develop, and lead a small, sharp team of SEO and AEO experts, and set the operating rhythm that keeps them moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in SEO with global scope, with hands-on AEO experience, at least 3 years leading a team, and experience working with executives. You’ve done this at a company where search is a real growth channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically deep. You understand how crawlers, rendering, and site architecture affect visibility, and how LLMs interpret and weight content differently from traditional search engines. You can debug with Engineering, not just brief them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about AI, bordering on obsessed. You use it every day, build with it, test new tools as they launch, and have a point of view on where search is going.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An analytical thinker who designs thoughtful experiments, reads the results honestly, and knows when to move fast and when to wait for the data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced across multiple discovery surfaces, such as app store listings, marketplaces, video, and communities, not only the website.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder with hands-on experience in AI agents and automation tools and an instinct for turning them into repeatable systems. You set your own priorities, know what to scale and what to cut, and ship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who builds teams people want to be on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
