&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The leaders who shape Klaviyo’s next chapter aren’t found by running a process. They’re found by someone who understands the business, knows our leaders, and can tell a great candidate why this is the place to do the best work of their career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our executive search partner for the R+D function, you’ll be a true partner to our leadership team. Close enough to the work that you know what keeps each leader up at night and what the right hire has to solve. You’ll tell our story with honesty and conviction, so the right executives lean in and the wrong ones know early that it’s not for them. And you’ll get to define what excellence looks like here. What does a white-glove executive experience feel like when AI is part of everything we do? You’ll answer that, and then you’ll build it.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you’ll make a difference:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ownership and Efficiency:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Klaviyo’s executive hiring initiative for our R+D functions, developing strategies for success in identifying, attracting, and winning director+ level talent across functional areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run every search like a business problem. Understand what the hire has to solve, then research the market, develop the search strategies, and bring forward candidates that fit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the standard. Create the guidelines, structure, and operating rhythm that make each search consistent, fast, and excellent as the function grows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a white-glove experience. Design how it feels to be an executive candidate at Klaviyo, personalized at every step and with AI working to your advantage in the background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draw insights from analytics to make better calls with data. Use what the funnel is telling you to find what is stuck, fix it, and keep improving the process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building Lasting Relationships:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a true partner to leaders, with a point of view. Be the voice in the room, bringing a perspective on the market, the profile, and the strategy. Have the confidence to push back when the data is telling you the plan needs to change. You’ll earn their trust by being honest.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an ambassador for Klaviyo. Bring our mission to life, include the hard parts, and make sure candidates know exactly what they are signing up for.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Treat every candidate, selected or not, with the empathy and polish that makes them an ambassador for us.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with outside firms where they add reach, and foster collaborative partnerships that enhance our talent network and brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Always learning:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay curious and keep raising the bar on your craft, your market knowledge, and how you use new tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring fresh, data-grounded perspectives that change how we recruit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of full-cycle recruiting experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of executive recruiting experience, experience working in the high-growth tech space is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a builder who sets ambitious goals and creates the standards others follow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You influence senior leaders and build trust with candidates and hiring partners alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay steady when priorities conflict, and you bring judgment and discretion to confidential searches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re driven to find and win the best leaders, and you enjoy the relationships you build along the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
