&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Klaviyo is seeking a strategic and ecosystem-minded Partner Manager to grow and develop our network of tech and platform partners in hotel; and other hospitality verticals.&amp;nbsp; You are a sales first minded individual with a fluency in Product. You’ll own relationships with leading PMS and Wellness platforms such as Mews, Oracle Opera, Mindbody, and more. Ensure integrations deliver seamless functionality and clear customer value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;As part of the Global Technology Partnerships organization, this role bridges tech relationship management, GTM execution, and vertical strategy. You will work with a dedicated team: partner marketing, hospitality BDRs, and R&amp;amp;D partners on integrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Your focus is the plan, the relationships and the proof points that make that team effective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Strategic Partner Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Lead management, enablement, and expansion of tech partners serving hotels and travel, with one accountable owner per partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Build joint strategic plans with top partners focused on integration adoption, co-marketing, product enhancements, and sales enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Manage relationships with executive, product and customer success contacts at partner organizations to align on mutual revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Integration &amp;amp; Product Alignment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Partner with Klaviyo’s or Partner’s R&amp;amp;D teams to enhance tech integrations from ideation through deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Ground every integration priority in customer pain: advocate for improved APIs, workflows, and data sync capabilities only where they solve a problem hotel customers have told us about or that limits adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Ensure integrations meet performance, scalability, and user experience standards that customers can see and feel, including consent and data-sync behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Maintain a clear view of integration coverage gaps, and prioritize tech targets that unlock customer growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Go-To-Market Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Partner Marketing, Regional Sales and BDRs to launch joint GTM campaigns, sales enablement materials, and co-selling initiatives that drive pipeline, integration adoption, and new ARR for these integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Equip BDRs, AEs and CSMs with partner-aligned collateral, target lists, and use cases that demonstrate hotel-specific value, and enable them on partner positioning and ideal customer profiles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Create repeatable frameworks for co-selling and co-servicing within the hospitality ecosystem, including partner customer and CSM introductions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Track key partner KPIs such as pipeline, integration adoption, co-sell impact, and customer outcomes. Using Salesforce and product data to focus effort on the highest-performing partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;8+ years in technology partnerships or sales within SaaS, ideally focused on Hospitality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Proven track record in building, scaling, and monetizing partner ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong technical literacy across API-based integrations, data interoperability, and CRM data (Salesforce).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Excellent relationship management and stakeholder communication skills, from technical to executive levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strategic, highly cross-functional builder with a bias toward action, who translates partner collaboration into measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
