&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Public Relations Lead to join Klaviyo&#39;s growing Communications team. This is a senior role for a strategic storyteller who can turn complex product and business narratives into compelling, media-ready stories, with a focus on corporate and product communications. You&#39;ll be a critical player in building out our AI and agent story for the enterprise and help tell it as we reposition Klaviyo as the autonomous B2C CRM. You&#39;ll partner directly with our Head of Communications and work closely with our C-suite, especially our Chief Product Officer, to bring these stories to life in unique and compelling ways that go beyond traditional media.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make a Difference:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own PR across corporate and product communications&lt;/strong&gt;, aligning media strategy and messaging with company goals, product launches, and business milestones.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive media engagement &lt;/strong&gt;across business, tech, trade and broadcast.&amp;nbsp; Proactively pitch stories, build relationships with media, and secure standout coverage while finding creative, non-traditional ways to tell our story too.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop executive thought leadership programs&lt;/strong&gt;: shape unique points of view, craft messaging and soundbites, grow executive presence on LinkedIn, and secure top-tier speaking and media opportunities for our C-suite - especially our Chief Product Officer but also supporting programs for our CTO, CMO and on occasion co-CEOs and CFO.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and evolve Klaviyo&#39;s agent story:&lt;/strong&gt; build a distinctive point of view that sets Klaviyo’s agents apart to help position Klaviyo as a leader in the agent and AI space.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead data-driven narrative development:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with product, marketing, and analytics teams to surface insights from Klaviyo’s platform and turn them into compelling narratives and media angles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage PR agencies&lt;/strong&gt;: Lead our relationship with our US and European PR agencies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support and train spokespeople&lt;/strong&gt;: providing message development, prep, and coaching for interviews, and speaking engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll also partner cross-functionally - especially with Product Marketing, Investor Relations, Content, Internal Comms - to identify timely, relevant stories and ensure our messaging is consistent, clear, and media-ready.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the content team on reactive blog posts responding to industry news&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use and build AI tools to automate and speed up the team&#39;s workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
